开启流式调用只需一个参数，返回值变成可异步迭代的 `Stream<ChatCompletionChunk>`：

```typescript
import OpenAI from 'openai';
const client = new OpenAI({ apiKey: process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY });
async function streamText(prompt: string): Promise<void> {
  const stream = await client.chat.completions.create({
    model: 'gpt-4o-mini',
    stream: true,
    messages: [{ role: 'user', content: prompt }],
  });
  for await (const chunk of stream) {
    const delta = chunk.choices[0]?.delta?.content ?? '';
    process.stdout.write(delta);
  }
  console.log();
}
```

每个 `chunk` 的类型是 `ChatCompletionChunk`，关键字段是 `choices[0].delta.content`——它是可选的字符串，可以是 `null` 或 `undefined`，所以必须用可选链 `?.` 和空值合并 `??` 防御性提取。底层协议是 HTTP Server-Sent Events（SSE），SDK 已封装好解析。

实际应用中既要实时显示增量，又需要收集完整文本，可以用一个累积器：

```typescript
interface StreamAccumulator {
  content: string;
  finishReason: string | null;
  promptTokens: number;
  completionTokens: number;
}
async function streamWithAccumulation(
  prompt: string
): Promise<StreamAccumulator> {
  const acc: StreamAccumulator = {
    content: '',
    finishReason: null,
    promptTokens: 0,
    completionTokens: 0,
  };
  const stream = await client.chat.completions.create({
    model: 'gpt-4o-mini',
    stream: true,
    stream_options: { include_usage: true },
    messages: [{ role: 'user', content: prompt }],
  });
  for await (const chunk of stream) {
    const delta = chunk.choices[0]?.delta?.content;
    if (delta) acc.content += delta;
    const reason = chunk.choices[0]?.finish_reason;
    if (reason) acc.finishReason = reason;
    if (chunk.usage) {
      acc.promptTokens = chunk.usage.prompt_tokens;
      acc.completionTokens = chunk.usage.completion_tokens;
    }
  }
  return acc;
}
```

注意 `finish_reason` 的类型是 `'stop' | 'length' | 'tool_calls' | 'content_filter' | null`，用它判断流为何结束。

`AbortController` 是 Web 标准 API，Node.js 16+ 和现代浏览器原生支持，用于取消异步操作：

```typescript
import OpenAI from 'openai';
const client = new OpenAI({ apiKey: process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY });
async function cancellableStream(
  prompt: string,
  timeoutMs = 30000
): Promise<{ content: string; cancelled: boolean }> {
  const controller = new AbortController();
  const timeoutId = setTimeout(() => controller.abort('请求超时'), timeoutMs);
  let content = '';
  let cancelled = false;
  try {
    const stream = await client.chat.completions.create(
      { model: 'gpt-4o-mini', stream: true,
        messages: [{ role: 'user', content: prompt }] },
      { signal: controller.signal }
    );
    for await (const chunk of stream) {
      content += chunk.choices[0]?.delta?.content ?? '';
    }
  } catch (error) {
    if (error instanceof Error && error.name === 'AbortError') {
      cancelled = true;
    } else throw error;
  } finally {
    clearTimeout(timeoutId);
  }
  return { content, cancelled };
}
```

关键：`AbortError` 是用户或超时主动取消，不应视为错误，应保留已收到的部分内容；其他错误才应该向上抛出。

一个流式消息的生命周期经历多个状态，用有限状态机管理可以防止非法跳转：

```typescript
type MessageStatus =
  | 'idle'
  | 'loading'
  | 'streaming'
  | 'done'
  | 'error'
  | 'cancelled';
const validTransitions: Record<MessageStatus, MessageStatus[]> = {
  idle: ['loading'],
  loading: ['streaming', 'error', 'cancelled'],
  streaming: ['done', 'error', 'cancelled'],
  done: [],
  error: [],
  cancelled: [],
};
function canTransition(
  from: MessageStatus,
  to: MessageStatus
): boolean {
  return validTransitions[from].includes(to);
}
```

`idle` → `loading`（发出请求）→ `streaming`（收到第一个 delta）→ `done`（正常结束）。任何从已终止状态（`done`/`error`/`cancelled`）发起的跳转都会被 `canTransition` 阻止。

流式调用中的错误需要细分，才能给用户展示有用的信息并决定是否重试：

```typescript
import OpenAI from 'openai';
type StreamErrorType =
  | 'network' | 'timeout' | 'rate_limit'
  | 'auth' | 'server' | 'cancelled' | 'unknown';
interface StreamError {
  type: StreamErrorType;
  message: string;
  retryable: boolean;
  retryAfterMs?: number;
}
function classifyStreamError(error: unknown): StreamError {
  if (error instanceof OpenAI.APIError) {
    if (error.status === 401)
      return { type: 'auth', message: 'API 密钥无效', retryable: false };
    if (error.status === 429) {
      const retryAfter = parseInt(
        error.headers?.['retry-after'] ?? '60', 10
      );
      return { type: 'rate_limit', message: '请求频率超限',
        retryable: true, retryAfterMs: retryAfter * 1000 };
    }
    if (error.status >= 500)
      return { type: 'server', message: '服务端错误', retryable: true };
  }
  if (error instanceof Error && error.name === 'AbortError')
    return { type: 'cancelled', message: '请求已取消', retryable: false };
  return { type: 'unknown', message: String(error), retryable: false };
}
```

工具定义的 TypeScript 类型是 `OpenAI.Chat.Completions.ChatCompletionTool`，参数用 JSON Schema 描述：

```typescript
import OpenAI from 'openai';
type ToolDef = OpenAI.Chat.Completions.ChatCompletionTool;
const weatherTool: ToolDef = {
  type: 'function',
  function: {
    name: 'get_weather',
    description: '获取指定城市的当前天气。当用户询问天气或需要基于天气做决策时使用。',
    parameters: {
      type: 'object',
      properties: {
        city: {
          type: 'string',
          description: '城市名称，如「北京」「上海」',
        },
        unit: {
          type: 'string',
          enum: ['celsius', 'fahrenheit'],
          description: '温度单位，默认 celsius',
        },
      },
      required: ['city'],
      additionalProperties: false,
    },
  },
};
```

`description` 对模型的正确调用率影响极大——要说清楚工具能做什么、何时该用、参数的含义和格式。

当模型决定调用工具时，`finish_reason` 变为 `'tool_calls'`，`message.tool_calls` 包含调用详情：

```typescript
interface ToolCall {
  id: string;
  type: 'function';
  function: {
    name: string;
    arguments: string;
  };
}
```

注意 `arguments` 是 JSON **字符串**，不是对象！必须用 `JSON.parse` 才能得到实际的参数对象：

```typescript
interface WeatherParams {
  city: string;
  unit?: 'celsius' | 'fahrenheit';
}
function parseToolArgs<T>(argsJson: string): T {
  try {
    return JSON.parse(argsJson) as T;
  } catch {
    throw new Error(`工具参数解析失败: ${argsJson}`);
  }
}
const params = parseToolArgs<WeatherParams>(tc.function.arguments);
console.log(params.city);
```

`JSON.parse` 需要包在 `try-catch` 里，因为模型偶尔可能输出格式不正确的 JSON。

```typescript
import OpenAI from 'openai';
const client = new OpenAI({ apiKey: process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY });
async function callWithTool(userMessage: string): Promise<string> {
  const messages: OpenAI.Chat.Completions.ChatCompletionMessageParam[] = [
    { role: 'user', content: userMessage },
  ];
  const firstResp = await client.chat.completions.create({
    model: 'gpt-4o',
    messages,
    tools: [weatherTool],
    tool_choice: 'auto',
  });
  const assistantMsg = firstResp.choices[0].message;
  if (firstResp.choices[0].finish_reason !== 'tool_calls') {
    return assistantMsg.content ?? '';
  }
  messages.push(assistantMsg);
  for (const tc of assistantMsg.tool_calls!) {
    const params = parseToolArgs<WeatherParams>(tc.function.arguments);
    const result = getWeather(params.city, params.unit);
    messages.push({
      role: 'tool',
      tool_call_id: tc.id,
      content: JSON.stringify(result),
    });
  }
  const finalResp = await client.chat.completions.create({
    model: 'gpt-4o', messages,
  });
  return finalResp.choices[0].message.content ?? '';
}
```

回传工具结果时，`role` 必须是 `'tool'`，`tool_call_id` 必须与对应的 `tool_call.id` 精确匹配，否则模型不知道哪个结果对应哪次调用。

工具增多时，用注册表统一管理定义和实现：

```typescript
type ToolHandler<P = Record<string, unknown>> =
  (params: P) => Promise<unknown> | unknown;
class ToolRegistry {
  private tools = new Map<string,
    { definition: OpenAI.Chat.Completions.ChatCompletionTool;
      handler: ToolHandler }>() ;
  register<P>(def: OpenAI.Chat.Completions.ChatCompletionTool,
              handler: ToolHandler<P>): this {
    this.tools.set(def.function.name,
      { definition: def, handler: handler as ToolHandler });
    return this;
  }
  getDefinitions() {
    return [...this.tools.values()].map((t) => t.definition);
  }
  async execute(
    tc: OpenAI.Chat.Completions.ChatCompletionMessageToolCall
  ): Promise<string> {
    const entry = this.tools.get(tc.function.name);
    if (!entry) return JSON.stringify({ error: `未知工具: ${tc.function.name}` });
    try {
      const params = JSON.parse(tc.function.arguments);
      const result = await entry.handler(params);
      return typeof result === 'string' ? result : JSON.stringify(result);
    } catch (e) {
      return JSON.stringify({ error: e instanceof Error ? e.message : String(e) });
    }
  }
}
```

`execute` 方法把错误转成包含 `error` 字段的 JSON 字符串而非直接抛出，这样模型收到错误信息后还能继续推理并告知用户原因。

用 `while` 循环让模型持续推理，直到 `finish_reason === 'stop'`：

```typescript
async function runWithTools(
  userMessage: string,
  maxIterations = 10
): Promise<string> {
  const messages: OpenAI.Chat.Completions.ChatCompletionMessageParam[] = [
    { role: 'user', content: userMessage },
  ];
  for (let i = 0; i < maxIterations; i++) {
    const resp = await client.chat.completions.create({
      model: 'gpt-4o',
      messages,
      tools: registry.getDefinitions(),
      tool_choice: 'auto',
    });
    const msg = resp.choices[0].message;
    messages.push(msg);
    if (resp.choices[0].finish_reason === 'stop') {
      return msg.content ?? '';
    }
    if (msg.tool_calls) {
      const results = await Promise.all(
        msg.tool_calls.map(async (tc) => ({
          tc,
          result: await registry.execute(tc),
        }))
      );
      for (const { tc, result } of results) {
        messages.push({
          role: 'tool', tool_call_id: tc.id, content: result,
        });
      }
    }
  }
  throw new Error(`超过最大迭代次数 (${maxIterations})`);
}
```

多个工具调用用 `Promise.all` 并发执行（在无依赖关系时），比串行快得多。

流式模式下，工具调用的参数分散在多个 chunk 里，需要按 `index` 累积：

```typescript
interface AccumulatedToolCall {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  argumentsBuffer: string;
}
const accumulators = new Map<number, AccumulatedToolCall>();
for await (const chunk of stream) {
  if (chunk.choices[0]?.delta?.tool_calls) {
    for (const tcDelta of chunk.choices[0].delta.tool_calls) {
      const idx = tcDelta.index;
      if (!accumulators.has(idx)) {
        accumulators.set(idx, {
          id: tcDelta.id ?? '',
          name: tcDelta.function?.name ?? '',
          argumentsBuffer: '',
        });
      }
      const acc = accumulators.get(idx)!;
      if (tcDelta.id) acc.id = tcDelta.id;
      if (tcDelta.function?.name) acc.name = tcDelta.function.name;
      if (tcDelta.function?.arguments) {
        acc.argumentsBuffer += tcDelta.function.arguments;
      }
    }
  }
}
```

流结束后，`accumulators` 中每个 `argumentsBuffer` 才是完整的 JSON 字符串，这时才能 `JSON.parse`。
